1 NAME Johan /Zotterman/
2 GIVN Johan
2 _MARNM Zotterman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 16 SEP 1937
1 DEAT
2 DATE SEP 2010
2 PLAC Hargshamn
