1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===She was a shining person and very artistic===
2 CONT  and painted some 20 big paintings in oil, but no exhebition.  A person with a lot of humanity and a big heart.  Married to the president of Poijes & Wettermark Electrical company,  which was prosperous in Stockholm 1930-1950 manu
2 CONC facturing and installing many  of the first indoor electrical lifts in stockholm  apartment buildings, in strong competition with graham Brothers and many others. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sadly the officebuilding of the company vanished in the 1970ties and made later place for the  now very popular  "Gallerian" opposite to NK in Hamngatan close to the kingsgarden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father a captain in the army belonging to the swedish nobilityfamily Malmerfeldt. Born in the end of the 18th century and lived to see the women of Sweden getting the right to vote for the governement.
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away in summer 1969 in Nacka Hospital. Burried in the familygrave in Rönninge at the chapel close to the highway, where her husband and husbands farther rests since long time ago.   Background: Malmerfelt[redigera | red
2 CONC igera wikitext] Malmerfelt är en svensk adelsätt från Umeå, Västerbotten.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stamfader för ätten är Moses Andersson som var borgare och handelsman i Umeå. Han var gift med Anna Grubb, en syster till Nils Grubb, och blev far till Olof Malmer, lagman och landshövding, gift 1725 med Anna Christina Cederborg. 
2 CONC Olof Malmer adlades den 19 september 1743 med namnet Malmerfelt, skrev sig till Norrby, Österby och Söderby, och introducerades 8 november 1746 som ätt nr. 1878.
