1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr. Jaffe was recorded as a naturalized citizen of the Grand Duchy of Posen on September 13, 1834 in Schwersenz. He was a Dr. Med. et Chir. or Medical Doctor ad Surgeon, and was the only person in the entire Duchy 
2 CONC recorded as both a medical doctor AND surgeon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: The Naturalized Jews of the Grand Duchy of Posen in 1834 and 1835, revised edition by Dr. Edward David Luft, published by Avotaynu in 2004. 
